# Deprecated API Version Paths

- Do not create, edit, rename, or delete files under any `v1` or `v2` API path.
- Treat all `v1` and `v2` code as read-only unless the user explicitly says to modify that version.
- Default all API work to `v3` and shared modules.

## Protected Paths

- `pantryPlusApiTs/src/v1/**`
- `pantryPlusApiTs/src/v2/**`
- `src/v1/**`
- `src/v2/**`

## If a requested fix appears to involve v1 or v2

- Explain that older API versions are deprecated in this workspace.
- Propose and implement the equivalent change in `v3` instead.
